<title>UK: SafBank Line to make Port Elizabeth call weekly.</title>
<headline>SafBank Line to make Port Elizabeth call weekly.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SafBank Line said its Express Container Service between Southern Africa and North America will call at Port Elizabeth weekly instead of fortnightly with immediate effect.</p>
<p>SafBank is a joint venture between SCL, which links South Africa's Safmarine and Belgium's CMBT Lines, and Bank Line, which is part of Andrew Weir Shipping of the UK. --Reuters Shipping News + 44 171 542 4087. Fax 5017</p>
</text>
